Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.97,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Cómo me voy a sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:02.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente si tengo 100 euros
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en la cuenta?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:03.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Hazlo así
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:04.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Para conseguir lo que quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:05.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tienes que ser la persona
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.39,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que ya lo tiene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Quieres vivir de tu proyecto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:08.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te sientas y dices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿cómo me voy a sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:10.63,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}bien si tengo 100€
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en la cuenta y estoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.75,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}estresado todo el puto día?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:13.18,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y ahí se queda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:14.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la mayoría de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}chocando con lo que ve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en su realidad hoy mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:17.06,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero tu vida no
