Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:18.82,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu vida se crea dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:19.52,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en lo que tú crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.17,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que mereces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:20.86,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y en lo que crees
